{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkj_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkj_02_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "10158d8dbc216ef058f9b2acf0c2df1c315ce97629c303d42c6e0cfb46587664", "ja": "コホン！　だから私たちも、一人ずつじゃなくて、\nみんなで力を合わせて！　一緒にがんばりましょうね♪", "zh": "咳咳！那么，大家期待已久的结果公布了。\n首先是『综合团队排名』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkj_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkj_02_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "d0b85e9e2f9f64284ef403c662b3ad01e7c67773f52de9dc853af165ca75366c", "ja": "あ……はいっ！\nわかりました、音無先輩♪", "zh": "啊……好的！\n我明白了，音无前辈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkj_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkj_02_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "b38c80d2d6f3979560ea93a57ba673228a1e94a62bc85d17dc3bdd34d47946a9", "ja": "今日も楽しかったですけど、次回はもっと、\nたくさんの感謝を届けられるように……。", "zh": "今天也很开心，不过下次，我想要传达更多更多的感谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
